# Audi Q4 nightly battery check.
#
# Install with:  crontab -e   (then paste the line below, adjusting the paths)
# View logs:     tail -f /path/to/ev-charge/battery.log
#
# Notes:
#   * cron runs with a minimal environment, so we cd into the project directory; config.py
#     loads ./.env from there via python-dotenv. (Alternatively set the AUDI_* / NTFY_* vars
#     directly in this crontab.)
#   * Use the venv's python so audiconnectpy/requests are importable.
#
# Runs nightly at 02:00:
0 2 * * * cd /path/to/ev-charge && /path/to/ev-charge/.venv/bin/python check_battery.py >> /path/to/ev-charge/battery.log 2>&1
